Band Description: A trio of reclusive signal-engineers—Vane, Volt, and Core—who never play the same show twice, as their sets depend entirely on the weather. Vane manipulates the primary melodic bit-sequences, Volt manages the electrical feed from the external antennas, and Core monitors the "Static-Gating" levels, keeping the sonic output from physically detonating the equipment. Their stage aesthetic is austere: they perform in silence, faces obscured by mirrored masks that reflect the strobing, unnatural purple flashes of the equipment failing under atmospheric pressure.

